{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Frenzy Force is a casual top-down shooter set in a diverse collection of biomes known only as The Menagerie.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Existing outside of space and time,\u00a0The Menagerie is home to formless, bloodthirsty shadow creatures with only one goal: to hunt down and eliminate anyone who enters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our brave heroes come from all walks of life, drawn together by the allure of The Menagerie's secrets. Although they have no connection to each other and their pasts are long forgotten, this daring expedition has given them a new identity: The Frenzy Force.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter The Menagerie at your own peril, and explore 16 unique biomes with over 30 weapons to aid you in your survival. Last as long as you can against relentless waves of enemies, either solo or with friends!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3257330?t=1759778991","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3257330?t=1759778991","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3257330/c3b19a9f1d49a6c3396cafd80c78ab5bc73f95e6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759778991","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3257330/c3b19a9f1d49a6c3396cafd80c78ab5bc73f95e6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759778991","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3356510,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Frenzy Force is a casual top-down shooter set in a diverse collection of biomes known only as The Menagerie.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Existing outside of space and ti